sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API layer
  participant S as ChatService
  participant R as Router
  participant F as FallbackExecutor
  participant P as Provider
  participant J as Judge
  participant D as SQLite

  C->>A: POST /v1/chat/completions (model=auto)
  A->>A: verify API key
  A->>S: chat(request)
  S->>S: start deadline, detect vision/tools/context needs
  S->>R: route(prompt, floor, constraints)
  R->>D: read judged history + segment quality
  R->>R: embed prompt, hard filters, score every model
  R-->>S: chosen model + explanation
  S->>F: execute(model)
  F->>P: generate()
  alt provider error or timeout
    P-->>F: error
    F->>F: record failure, open circuit after 3, try next tier
    F->>P: generate() on fallback model
  end
  P-->>F: answer
  F->>J: score answer
  alt score below escalation threshold
    F->>P: escalate one tier and re-judge
  end
  F->>D: outcome row (model, task, cost, quality, embedding)
  S->>D: routing log row
  opt shadow mode on
    S->>R: what would the learned router pick?
    S->>D: shadow decision (no provider call)
  end
  S-->>C: answer + cost + routing explanation
